#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:157 e68059d83c1644959025897a2658ec2a
msgid ""
"The relationship in the inner join condition is an equal-quantity relation, "
"returning all data that satisfies the join condition. If no match is found, the "
"query result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"内部连接条件中的关系是等量关系，返回满足连接条件的所有数据。如果找不到匹配的数"
"据，查询结果将返回空结果集。"

