#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:190 cdfb3154df074a4482ee2efac47356cf
msgid "2. Inner Join (non-equivalent)"
msgstr "2. 内连接（非等价）"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:192 59a365cd0dd148598dd1d7a74fe87d9b
msgid ""
"The relationship in the inner join condition is a non-equivalent relationship, "
"returning all data that satisfies the join condition. If no match is found, the "
"query result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"内连接条件中的关系是一种非等价关系，会返回满足连接条件的所有数据。如果找不到匹配"
"数据，查询结果将返回空结果集。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:223 86eeceb1510049b5ac7f490aa1abfb96
msgid "3. Full join"
msgstr "3. 全连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:225 288a70046690463e8181bc82b850ef7a
msgid ""
"The join table will contain all the records from the two tables. The join "
"statement is equivalent to multiplying the two tables and using the NULL value "
"as the result of missing matches on both sides."
msgstr ""
"连接表将包含两个表中的所有记录。连接语句相当于将两个表相乘，并使用 NULL 值作为双"
"方缺失匹配的结果。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:238 ca5dd749374a445094adefc64a4145ef
msgid "Result set"
msgstr "结果集"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:257 beb77cba7f6c41b790011a08ea83a81f
msgid "4. Cross join"
msgstr "4. 交叉连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:259 9671c0e719004a268435765096ab582b
msgid "Returns the Cartesian product of joined tables."
msgstr "返回连接表的笛卡尔乘积。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:295 e7e1f763a1564938aed444f38e36415e
msgid "5. Left join"
msgstr "5. 左连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:297 809e17bd6a7b4932bf5ce6f2e6dbe90e
msgid ""
"Get all records in the left table, even if there is no corresponding matching "
"data in the right table. If no match is found, the query result returns an "
"empty result set."
msgstr ""
"获取左表中的所有记录，即使右表中没有相应的匹配数据。如果未找到匹配数据，查询结果"
"将返回空结果集。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:329 8913c7b6ef84488ba2c62f95d80d31c0
msgid "6. Right join"
msgstr "6. 右连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_query_operator.md:331 ee3f8b7511224a11a97d0fee9826070b
msgid ""
"Get all the data in the data table on the right, even if there is no "
"corresponding data in the table on the left. If no match is found, the query "
"result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"获取右侧数据表中的所有数据，即使左侧数据表中没有相应数据。如果未找到匹配数据，查"
"询结果将返回空结果集。"
